# Signature text handoff

Anytime a signature is required, give the exact text in that same message. Say **Sign this** and name the output path outside the signed text.

- IDE: one fenced block whose body is only the signed text.
- Terminal: a start marker line immediately above and an end marker line immediately below. The markers are not signed.

SSOT: [`AGENTS.md`](../../AGENTS.md) and [`.agents/instructions/signature-text-handoff.md`](../../.agents/instructions/signature-text-handoff.md).
